{
  "id": "20661_kifusuru",
  "headword": "{寄付|きふ}する",
  "reading": "きふする",
  "romaji": "kifusuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to donate; to contribute",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to donate; to contribute; to give (money, goods) to a cause or organization",
      "explanation": "To voluntarily give money or goods to a charity, religious institution, or public cause without expecting anything in return."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "20661_kifusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{被災地|ひさいち}に{寄付|きふ}した。",
      "english": "I donated to the disaster area.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20661_kifusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "NPOに{毎月|まいつき}{千円|せんえん}を{寄付|きふ}している。",
      "english": "I donate a thousand yen every month to an NPO.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20661_kifusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{多|おお}くの{市民|しみん}が{図書館|としょかん}の{建設|けんせつ}{資金|しきん}として{寄付|きふ}を{呼|よ}びかけに{応|おう}じた。",
      "english": "Many citizens responded to the call for donations toward the construction of the library.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The standard word for making charitable donations. Can be used as both a noun ({寄付|きふ}) and a verb ({寄付|きふ}する). In Japan, donation culture has grown significantly, especially after major natural disasters.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {寄付|きふ}を{募|つの}る: to solicit donations\n- {寄付|きふ}{金|きん}: donation money\n- {寄付|きふ}を{受|う}け{付|つ}ける: to accept donations\n- {匿名|とくめい}で{寄付|きふ}する: to donate anonymously\n- ふるさと{納税|のうぜい}: hometown tax donation (a popular tax-deductible donation system)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {寄贈|きぞう}する: to donate (goods, especially books or artworks) — focuses on physical items given to institutions\n- {献金|けんきん}する: to make a monetary contribution — often political or religious\n- {募金|ぼきん}する: to collect donations — refers to the act of fundraising, not giving",
